The Vomit Gore Trilogy is a feature film trilogy of Canadian surrealist extreme horror films written and directed by Shawn
Fedorchuk (as Lucifer Valentine) with the first two instalments produced by Randy Price (as No One Body).

11
00:45:22,500 --> 00:45:28,500
Fedorchuk coined "vomit gore" as a new subgenre to describe the trilogy, which follows a nonlinear narrative
that centers around teenage runaway Angela Aberdeen, a stripper who suffers from bulimia.

12
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
